Student Management System

A web-based Student Management System developed to manage student records, attendance, subject-wise marks, and report cards.

Features

- Add, search, edit, and delete student records
- Manage student attendance
- Save subject-wise marks
- Generate student report cards
- Dashboard with student statistics

Technologies Used

- Python
- Flask
- HTML
- CSS
- JavaScript

Project Structure

- "app.py" — Flask application
- "templates/" — HTML templates
- "static/" — CSS and JavaScript files (if used in this project)

How to Run

1. Install Python.
2. Install the required dependencies from "requirements.txt".
3. Run the Flask application using the command configured in "app.py".

